[{"data":1,"prerenderedAt":111},["ShallowReactive",2],{"news-detail-ioe-centenary-scholarships-2026-at-ucl-fully-funded-116":3},{"news":4,"more":28},{"id":5,"slug":6,"title":7,"content":8,"authorName":9,"authorId":10,"status":11,"recommended":12,"datePosted":13,"deadline":14,"images":15,"notifiedAt":14,"notifiedBy":14,"createdAt":13,"updatedAt":21,"categories":22,"readTime":27},116,"ioe-centenary-scholarships-2026-at-ucl-fully-funded-116","Ioe Centenary Scholarships 2026 At Ucl | Fully Funded","\u003Cp>IOE Centenary Graduate Scholarships Abstract\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Scholarship Host: UCL Institute of Education\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Study Abroad: \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fscholarsworld.ng\u002Fscholarship\u002F?utm_source=Google&amp;utm_medium=Catergory&amp;utm_campaign=Email+Campaign\">Study Abroad\u003C\u002Fa> || \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fscholarsworld.ng\u002Fscholarship\u002Fscholarships-in-europe\u002F?utm_source=Google&amp;utm_medium=Catergory&amp;utm_campaign=Email+Campaign\">Study-In-Europe\u003C\u002Fa> || \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fscholarsworld.ng\u002Fscholarship\u002Fscholarships-in-uk\u002F?utm_source=Google&amp;utm_medium=Catergory&amp;utm_campaign=Email+Campaign\">Study-In-UK\u003C\u002Fa> \u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Location: United Kingdom\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Category: \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fscholarsworld.ng\u002Fscholarships\u002F?utm_source=Google&amp;utm_medium=Catergory&amp;utm_campaign=Email+Campaign\">Scholarships\u003C\u002Fa> || \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fscholarsworld.ng\u002Fscholarships\u002Fpostgraduate-scholarships\u002F?utm_source=Google&amp;utm_medium=Catergory&amp;utm_campaign=Email+Campaign\">Postgraduate Scholarships\u003C\u002Fa> || \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fscholarsworld.ng\u002Fscholarships\u002Fmasters-scholarships\u002F?utm_source=Google&amp;utm_medium=Catergory&amp;utm_campaign=Email+Campaign\">Masters Scholarships\u003C\u002Fa> || \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fscholarsworld.ng\u002Fscholarships\u002Fphd-scholarships\u002F?utm_source=Google&amp;utm_medium=Catergory&amp;utm_campaign=Email+Campaign\">PhD Scholarships\u003C\u002Fa> \u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Benefits: Full Scholarship\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Full Tuition\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Accommodation\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Living Stipends £8300\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Eligibility: Developing Countries\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Deadline: May 4, 2026\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>IOE Centenary Masters Scholarships 2026 Benefits\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>IOE Centenary Masters Scholarships 2026 offer the following benefits:\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Full Tuition\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Accommodation\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Annual stipend of £8300 for doctoral scholarships\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>IOE Centenary Scholarships Requirements\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>To be eligible for the master's and doctoral UCL IOE Centenary Scholarships, applicants must satisfy the following conditions:\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>domiciled in an eligible low or lower-middle-income country according to the \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fdatahelpdesk.worldbank.org\u002Fknowledgebase\u002Farticles\u002F906519-world-bank-country-and-lending-groups#:~:text=For%20the%20current%202024%20fiscal,those%20with%20a%20GNI%20per\">World Bank classification\u003C\u002Fa>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>have an official unconditional offer to study a full time PhD degree at IOE (letter issued by UCL Admissions).\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>not have studied or lived in the UK before.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>How To Apply for UCL Centenary Scholarship in UCL\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>To apply for the UCL Centenary Masters\u002FPhD Scholarship, follow the instructions we have outlined below; \u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Read the information we have provided on this webpage and ensure your eligibility\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Apply for a provisional masters programme in IOE\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>complete and submit the online scholarship application.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>APPLY HERE:\u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fwww.ucl.ac.uk\u002Fioe\u002Fabout-ioe\u002Four-global-reach\u002Fscholarships-and-funding#eligible-countries\">https:\u002F\u002Fwww.ucl.ac.uk\u002Fioe\u002Fabout-ioe\u002Four-global-reach\u002Fscholarships-and-funding#eligible-countries\u003C\u002Fa>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>\u003C\u002Fp>","LINKSKOOL",16,"published",0,"2026-04-06 12:03:41",null,[16],{"fileName":17,"oldFileName":17,"type":18,"file":19,"url":20},"assets\u002Felearning\u002Flrm\u002Fexplore\u002Fnews\u002Fioe-centenary-scholarships-2026-at-ucl-fully-funded\u002F69d3930d4655d1.26706761_screenshot 2026-04-06 113346.png","image","","https:\u002F\u002Flinkskool.com\u002Fassets\u002Felearning\u002Flrm\u002Fexplore\u002Fnews\u002Fioe-centenary-scholarships-2026-at-ucl-fully-funded\u002F69d3930d4655d1.26706761_screenshot%202026-04-06%20113346.png","2026-06-24 11:55:43",[23],{"id":24,"name":25,"createdAt":26},2,"Opportunities","2026-01-07 13:35:07",1,[29,38,48,58,67,76,85,94,102],{"id":30,"slug":31,"title":32,"images":33,"datePosted":37,"authorName":9},305,"dartmouth-college-kings-scholarship-usa-2026-fully-funded-opportunity","Dartmouth College Kings Scholarship Usa 2026: Fully Funded Opportunity",[34],{"fileName":35,"oldFileName":35,"type":18,"file":19,"url":36},"assets\u002Felearning\u002Flrm\u002Fexplore\u002Fnews\u002Fdartmouth-college-kings-scholarship-usa-2026-fully-funded-opportunity\u002F6a3c3537be16a2.95289717_screenshot 2026-06-24 204255.png","https